[32m+[m[32m## Real-data foundation (BTS + NOAA)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe `falsifier_x_air.data` package prepares observed aviation records and dynamic[m
[32m+[m[32mgraph inputs; it does not implement an ST-GNN or claim causal discovery from[m
[32m+[m[32mobservational data. BTS Reporting Carrier On-Time Performance files provide the[m
[32m+[m[32mflight records. NOAA/NCEI Global Hourly ISD files provide station weather.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mConfigure a bounded period, filters, paths, graph windows, and chronological[m
[32m+[m[32msplit cutoffs in [configs/data.toml](configs/data.toml). Provide authoritative[m
[32m+[m[32mairport metadata at `data/metadata/airports.csv` (`airport_code`, latitude,[m
[32m+[m[32mlongitude, IANA `timezone`) and NOAA station metadata at[m
[32m+[m[32m`data/metadata/noaa_stations.csv` (`station_id`, latitude, longitude; optional[m
[32m+[m[32m`availability_score`). These metadata files are inputs, not Python constants.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```powershell[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline download-bts --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline validate-bts --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline download-noaa --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline prepare --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline build-graph --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32mpython -m falsifier_x_air.data.pipeline validate --config configs/data.toml[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRaw downloads live under `data/raw/`; interim and generated tables under[m
[32m+[m[32m`data/interim/` and `data/processed/` are ignored by Git. The pipeline creates[m
[32m+[m[32mcanonical timezone-aware flight records, backward-only origin-weather features,[m
[32m+[m[32mchronological train/validation/test labels, observed rotation and airport-temporal[m
[32m+[m[32medges, and a configuration-hashed manifest. Actual delay and delay-cause columns[m
[32m+[m[32mare outcomes/post-outcome fields and must not enter prediction-time inputs.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIf BTS changes its automated archive endpoint, obtain the original Reporting[m
[32m+[m[32mCarrier archive through the official TranStats Download page and place its `.zip`[m
[32m+[m[32mor `.csv` in `data/raw/bts/`. Run `validate-bts` before preparation; it rejects[m
[32m+[m[32mempty files, non-ZIP error pages, archives without exactly one CSV, and inputs[m
[32m+[m[32mmissing the required BTS schema.[m
